flowchart TD
    A[Employee opens portal] --> B[Enter issue title, description and requester]
    B --> C{Valid ticket details?}
    C -- No --> D[Show validation errors]
    D --> B
    C -- Yes --> E[Create ticket with status New]
    E --> F[Employee tracks ticket in My Tickets]
    E --> G[Support opens ticket from work queue]
    G --> H{Use optional AI analysis?}
    H -- No --> I[Analyst confirms category and priority]
    H -- Yes --> J[Request AI analysis]
    J --> K{Analysis available?}
    K -- No --> L[Show warning and offer retry]
    L --> J
    L --> I
    K -- Yes --> M[Show suggested category, priority and troubleshooting steps]
    M --> N{Analyst review}
    N -- Accept --> O[Save suggested values as confirmed values]
    N -- Correct --> P[Save analyst-selected values and correction feedback]
    O --> Q[Record review and usefulness feedback]
    P --> Q
    Q --> I
    I --> R[Change status to In Progress]
    R --> S[Investigate issue and add support comments]
    S --> T{Issue addressed?}
    T -- No --> S
    T -- Yes --> U[Analyst changes status to Resolved]
    U --> V[Employee reviews resolution and activity history]
    V --> W{Further investigation needed?}
    W -- Yes --> X[Support reopens ticket as In Progress]
    X --> S
    W -- No --> Y[Ticket remains Resolved]
